00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:02.340
The 2024 Senate map is not a great map for
Democrats.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:07.879
Remember that with 100 senators in the Senate
every two years, a third of them are up for

00:04:07.879 --> 00:04:08.879
