00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:11.940
And that potentially is going to do well in
terms of fundraising.

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:16.360
There are Republicans who have the potential
with major Republican Senate campaign support

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:17.460
to also do well.

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:23.290
But the encouraging sign here is it does it
right now.

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:28.720
